[00:27.93]1. As your Son rose up from the Jordan
[00:34.21]And your precious words filled his heart,
[00:40.80]He was deeply moved by your purpose,
[00:47.20]And he longed to play his part.
[00:53.84]He refused to yield to temptation.
[01:00.40]He was zealous for your name.
[01:07.10]He gave ev’rything he could give you,
[01:13.63]And I long to do the same.
[01:16.63](Chorus)
[01:19.63]To do your will is my delight.
[01:25.63]I give you all my strength and might.
[01:32.63]This joy I feel; this joy is real.
[01:40.70]I will walk on in your light.
[01:45.70]To do your will is my delight.
[01:51.70]I have a hope so clear and bright.
[01:58.70]Your love I feel; your love is real.
[02:06.14]I will praise you day and night.
[02:12.14]It’s my delight.
[02:19.48]2. As I’ve come to know you, Jehovah,
[02:25.82]I’ve found happiness deep inside.
[02:32.25]I will gladly speak as your witness,
[02:38.65]And your truth I will not hide.
[02:45.17]Serving side by side with my brothers,
[02:51.85]There’s no better way to live.
[02:58.46]I will bear your name, oh, so proudly.
[03:04.99]I’ll give all that I can give.
[03:07.99](Chorus)
[03:10.99]To do your will is my delight.
[03:16.99]I give you all my strength and might.
[03:23.99]This joy I feel; this joy is real.
[03:31.10]I will walk on in your light.
[03:37.10]To do your will is my delight.
[03:43.60]I have a hope so clear and bright.
[03:50.10]Your love I feel; your love is real.
[03:56.92]I will praise you day and night.
